const kakaoPlaceTypes=[{key:'convenience',label:'편의시설',code:'CS2',color:'#0e7490',icon:'convenience'},{key:'hospital',label:'편의시설',code:'HP8',color:'#0e7490',icon:'convenience'},{key:'pharmacy',label:'편의시설',code:'PM9',color:'#0e7490',icon:'convenience'},{key:'culture',label:'문화시설',code:'CT1',color:'#7c3aed',icon:'culture'},{key:'attraction',label:'관광명소',code:'AT4',color:'#ca8a04',icon:'attraction'},{key:'karaoke',label:'문화시설',keyword:'노래방',color:'#7c3aed',icon:'culture'}];
function getKakaoPlaceResults(type, location, radius, bounds=null, depth=0){return new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const all=[],places=new kakao.maps.services.Places(),callback=async(results,status,pagination)=>{if(status===kakao.maps.services.Status.ERROR){reject(new Error('장소 검색을 완료하지 못했습니다.'));return;}if(status===kakao.maps.services.Status.OK)all.push(...results);if(status===kakao.maps.services.Status.OK&&pagination.hasNextPage){pagination.nextPage();return;}const unique=[...new Map(all.map(item=>[item.id,item])).values()],limited=unique.length>=45;if(limited&&depth<3){const lat=location.getLat(),lng=location.getLng(),extent=bounds||[lng-radius/(111320*Math.cos(lat*Math.PI/180)),lat-radius/111320,lng+radius/(111320*Math.cos(lat*Math.PI/180)),lat+radius/111320],mx=(extent[0]+extent[2])/2,my=(extent[1]+extent[3])/2,quadrants=[[extent[0],extent[1],mx,my],[mx,extent[1],extent[2],my],[extent[0],my,mx,extent[3]],[mx,my,extent[2],extent[3]]];try{const children=[];for(const quadrant of quadrants)children.push(await getKakaoPlaceResults(type,location,radius,quadrant,depth+1));resolve({type,items:[...new Map(children.flatMap(child=>child.items).map(item=>[item.id,item])).values()],limited:children.some(child=>child.limited)});}catch(error){reject(error);}return;}const lat=location.getLat(),lng=location.getLng();resolve({type,limited,items:unique.filter(item=>{const dy=(Number(item.y)-lat)*111320,dx=(Number(item.x)-lng)*111320*Math.cos(lat*Math.PI/180);return Math.hypot(dx,dy)<=radius;})});};const options={location,radius,size:15};if(bounds)options.rect=bounds.join(',');if(type.code)places.categorySearch(type.code,callback,options);else places.keywordSearch(type.keyword,callback,options);});}
